      <div type="layout" source="#source-726-1063" rend="page-horizontal-center source-blank-lines-before(2) source-blank-lines-after(2)">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-765-1057" rend="font-size large(1)">
          <div type="layout" source="#source-812-1013" style="padding-inline-start: 9em">
            <p source="#source-847-900"><seg source="#source-847-900">那須ヶ峰にのぼる煙りのこころあらば</seg></p>
            <p source="#source-900-977"><seg source="#source-900-977">雲井につげよ民の心を　（明治十七年）　　　　　正造</seg></p>
          </div>
        </div>
